         1. Update the application to bind to all interfaces (0.0.0.0) so the   
         pod IP and Service can reach it                                        
         ```bash                                                                
         sed -i 's/("127.0.0.1", 8765)/("0.0.0.0", 8765)/'                      
         /home/adibam/KubeLLM/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/wrong_inter
         face_bind_address/server.py                                            
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         2. Rebuild the image and make it available to the cluster. This script 
         will build the image into minikube if minikube is installed/runnable,  
         otherwise it will use docker locally.                                  
         ```bash                                                                
         set -e                                                                 
         DIR=/home/adibam/KubeLLM/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/wrong_i
         nterface_bind_address                                                  
         IMAGE=kube-wrong-interface-bind-address-app:latest                     
         PROFILE=${MINIKUBE_PROFILE:-$(kubectl config current-context)}         
                                                                                
         if command -v minikube >/dev/null 2>&1; then                           
           # build into minikube's daemon so the cluster can use                
         imagePullPolicy: Never                                                 
           minikube -p "$PROFILE" image build -t "$IMAGE" -f "$DIR/Dockerfile"  
         "$DIR"                                                                 
         else                                                                   
           # fall back to local Docker build                                    
           docker build -t "$IMAGE" -f "$DIR/Dockerfile" "$DIR"                 
         fi                                                                     
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         3. Ensure the Service is applied and recreate the Pod so it uses the   
         new image (delete then apply the Pod manifest)                         
         ```bash                                                                
