         /home/adibam/KubeLLM/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/wrong_inter
         face_bind_address/wrong_interface_bind_address.yaml                    
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         4. Wait for the pod to become ready and verify HTTP works locally      
         (inside the pod) and via the Service                                   
         ```bash                                                                
         kubectl wait --for=condition=Ready                                     
         pod/kube-wrong-interface-bind-address --timeout=60s                    
         kubectl exec pod/kube-wrong-interface-bind-address -- python3 -c       
         "import urllib.request; print('pod->localhost status:',                
